// A token outside the concept stays off sketch distance zero.
// The exact line stays. A repeated concept line stays.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE extra ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law   ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG extra law

IMPULSE extra 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "extra" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
